[71.925237, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.652126ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.653075ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.3702ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.396045ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.380924ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ branch selection uses exact stack IDs and leaves unrelated resources alone \u001b[90m(0.2726ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ deletion order handles shuffled listings, shared prerequisites and disconnected resources \u001b[90m(0.310465ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ external dependents block teardown without being selected \u001b[90m(0.224308ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ empty and already-deleted environments have empty plans \u001b[90m(0.388873ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cycles fail planning instead of issuing an unsafe partial teardown \u001b[90m(2.048763ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
